hackit2 - Hack It (Burak, Andrey, Jose, Mateo), Industrial Agents Hackathon 2026, Munich.

This agent is a rewritten and restructured derivative of ProcureCabana by team Codacabana
(European Hackathon League Grand Finale 2026, Tacto challenge), reference commit
2a9d9a4c936b408a162bddd60ef54382f9ec9b16, reused under the hackathon's open-code terms as
confirmed by the organisers. Module layout, naming, comments, prompts and the model transport
were rewritten by Hack It; the negotiation behaviour was preserved.

It is built on the Tacto Negotiation Arena starter kit (MIT licence),
https://github.com/tacto-playground/negotiation-arena-kit.
